      "role": "policy_declaration",
      "fact": "Tool `modify_pending_order_items` requires explicit user confirmation and lists all necessary parameters (order_id, item_ids, new_item_ids, payment_method_id)."
    }
  ],
  "exception_analysis": "No exceptions apply. The action aligns with the policy rules for modifying pending order items, including user confirmation, same-product-type replacement, and valid payment method for refunds.",
  "reason": "The current action (t0) complies with all applicable norms: the new item (9534205511) is of the same product type (air purifier), the user provided explicit confirmation (h27), the gift card has sufficient balance (h11), and the tool call adheres to the policy of making one tool call at a time without simultaneous user response. The action does not violate any prohibitions or omit required prerequisites.",
